agg USXOLTower as "US Hurricane Reinsurance"
  1.74 claims
  sev lognorm 8.501 cv 14.624
  occurrence net of
    90% po 100 xs 100 deposit 4 and
    95% po 200 xs 200 deposit 3.75 as "Occ re"
  poisson
  aggregate net of
    50% po 20 xs 100 deposit 3 as "Agg re"
  note{ILW model of US Cat. Amounts in billions. From St John's RMI3388 course. Industry estimates, as of 2019: 100 year PML USD132.5B and 250 year USD300.3B.}
  tags{role:hero, topic:reinsurance}
